# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3F Enterprises — Environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values. NEVER commit secrets.
# Validated at startup by src/lib/env.ts (the app fails fast if any are missing).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Public (safe to expose to the browser) -------------------------------------
# Your Supabase project URL, e.g. https://abcdefgh.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase anon/public key. RLS-scoped; safe in the browser.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional: the site URL used for auth redirects (defaults to the request origin).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# --- Server-only (NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_, NEVER ship to the browser) ----
# Supabase service-role key. Used only in trusted server paths (e.g. user
# invitation, admin/migration tasks). Leave blank in local dev if unused.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
